    "sections": {
        "description": "LMSCourse is the Best LMS Online Courses WordPress Theme designed for educators, institutions, and online course creators. Built with the powerful Elementor page builder, LMSCourse offers full design flexibility without touching a line of code. Seamlessly integrated with the popular LearnPress plugin, it provides a complete Learning Management System to create, manage, and sell online courses with ease. Whether you're launching a single instructor site or a full-scale online academy, LMSCourse delivers professional layouts, student dashboards, course quizzes, and payment integration out of the box. Fully responsive and SEO-optimized, this theme ensures your courses look stunning and rank well across all devices. View Demo at https://demo.themesartist.com/lmscoursefree/"
    },
